      "source": "For example, if you pass the categories [`kCICategoryBuiltIn`](kcicategorybuiltin.md) and [`kCICategoryColorAdjustment`](kcicategorycoloradjustment.md), you obtain all the filters that are members of both the built-in and color adjustment categories.",
